<div class="terminology-note">
  <details>
    <summary>A note on terminology</summary>
    <p>
      This site does not relinquish the name Bitcoin or its established identity following the chain split.
      Accordingly, Bitcoin refers to the BLAKE2b chain unless a distinction is necessary. Where both chains must be
      identified explicitly, we use <strong>BTC-BLAKE2B</strong> and <strong>BTC-SHA256</strong>, respectively.
    </p>
  </details>
</div>
